---
---

<section class="py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-neutral-50 border-y border-brand-border text-center">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Big Quote Heading -->
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-light italic text-brand-dark tracking-tight mb-6">
      "Porque las cosas bien hechas, <span class="font-normal text-brand-magenta not-italic">bien parecen</span>"
    </h2>

    <p class="text-brand-muted text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 font-light leading-relaxed">
      Cada aplicación simplifica un proceso y aumenta la capacidad de los usuarios. Imagina el impacto cuando todo el mundo tiene la herramienta adecuada para su trabajo.
    </p>

    <!-- Laptop Device Mockup Preview -->
    <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <div class="p-4 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-brand-border shadow-xl">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 sm:grid-cols-6 gap-6 items-center justify-center p-6 bg-neutral-50 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-200 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-magenta shadow-sm">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-dark">Calendar</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-200 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan shadow-sm">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-dark">CRM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-200 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-magenta shadow-sm">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-dark">Documents</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-200 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan shadow-sm">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-dark">Contabilidad</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-200 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-magenta shadow-sm">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-dark">Inventario</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-200 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan shadow-sm">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-dark">Planillas</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Callout & Actions -->
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-dark mb-6">
      Ayudamos a todas las empresas con un ERP orientado a digitalizar sus procesos.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-4">
      <a
        href="/contacto"
        class="px-6 py-3 rounded bg-brand-dark text-white text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-black transition-colors shadow-md"
      >
        Pedir demostración
      </a>
      <a
        href="/industrias"
        class="px-6 py-3 rounded border border-brand-border bg-white text-brand-dark text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-neutral-50 transition-colors"
      >
        Ver industrias →
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted font-light">
      Demostración con datos del rubro de tu empresa, sin compromiso.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
